        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run, Shoot, Alive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pure and simple top-down shooter with one rule — you have only <strong>3 seconds</strong>.<br>As soon as the timer starts, eliminate an enemy to rewind time back to 3 seconds.<br>Fail to do so, and the run ends instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear every enemy on the current floor to open the way forward. Move to the next floor, reset the clock, and repeat the cycle for as long as you can keep going.<br>There are no upgrades, no scoreboards, and no distractions — just you, the timer, and the enemies in your way.</p>",
